 on 26 Dec. 2013 // We were super excited to get in this UFREE Action Ride on Toy Horse! This Horse has to be one of the funnest toy's I have ever seen! For older and younger people! It is simply amazing that this can move without any sort of power! Unlike a rocking horse, this horse rolls as you bounce up and down! It rolls since they have wheels under all four hoofs. You bounce up and down makes the horse go forward like a real horse galloping.I am super impressed with the stunning quality, durability, and high quality material. The outside is very soft while the inside is steel. This makes it sturdy yet comfortable. Putting this horse together was very easy since it only required you do to one thing. Simply put the head on. The tools you need are included, making it even easier to put together. Since this horse does not require batteries, as soon as you put together your child will be good to go!!This horse is aged for children 4 to 15, However my 1.5 year old loved it just as much! Although he had to ride with someone. Also, I am 23 and had a BLAST on it!Over all, I would recommend this to any child and any gender. This is great for toddlers or even older children. This was very durable and made with a stunning quality. I love this, as does the rest of my family. If possible, I would give this toy a 10 star review.*Sample Provided for Review | Five Stars // 5.0 // 17 Oct. 2014 // By

    David Sheldon

 on 17 Oct. 2014 // We saw a similar ride-on horse at the Calgary Stampede Trade Show 3 years ago when our little daughter was 5 years old.  She wanted one so bad but we passed.  Well, every year since she has kept asking Santa for one for Christmas, drawing a picture every year and so this year we decided to see if we could find one on line.  I had a friend order a UFREE HORSE from AMAZON.  It was $484.00 and it came in less than 2 weeks.  We stored it until Christmas Eve and my husband said it was a snap to assemble and my goodness what a hit on Christmas morning!  I had a feeling this was going to be the most special present ever for our daughter and it sure was.  What a great invention!  It goes great in our house on the hardwood floor and it actually turns around corners...very impressive!  It looks super durable and we may or may not take it outside this summer, we will see.  She rides it for hours and then just sits on it watching TV.  Brilliant!  So happy with this product.  It is not inexpensive but worth every penny.  Thank you AMAZON. | Good bargain // 5.0 // 25 Dec. 2015 // By

